WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:16.337
The next morning, Glumdalclitch told me what she had found out.

2
00:00:16.338 --> 00:00:21.512
"Our neighbor thought you were very rude and he's angry with you.

3
00:00:21.513 --> 00:00:26.075
He told my father that people would pay him to see you.

4
00:00:26.076 --> 00:00:34.256
Papa is going to take you to town on the next market day and put you on display."

5
00:00:34.257 --> 00:00:36.674
She was crying now.

6
00:00:36.675 --> 00:00:39.793
"People will stare at you."

7
00:00:39.794 --> 00:00:45.193
"Hmm," I said, "perhaps nothing bad will happen."

8
00:00:45.194 --> 00:00:50.435
"But what if people hurt you or drop you?" she said.

9
00:00:50.436 --> 00:00:56.681
"Papa told me you were mine, but now he wants to show you off to get money.

10
00:00:56.682 --> 00:01:05.486
It's just like what he did last year when he gave me a lamb."

11
00:01:05.487 --> 00:01:07.806
She cried harder.

12
00:01:07.807 --> 00:01:11.518
"What happened?" I asked nervously.

13
00:01:11.519 --> 00:01:16.572
"I cared for the lamb, and it grew into a fine, fat sheep.

14
00:01:16.573 --> 00:01:23.953
Then Papa sold it to the butcher."

15
00:01:23.954 --> 00:01:28.400
She sobbed unhappily at the memory of her lost pet lamb.

16
00:01:28.401 --> 00:01:32.594
But I was not quite as worried as Glumdalclitch.

17
00:01:32.595 --> 00:01:37.347
And I still had hope that one day I would be free again.

18
00:01:37.348 --> 00:01:41.304
On market day, my master put me in a box.

19
00:01:41.305 --> 00:01:46.518
It had an opening for a door and some holes in the top to let in air.

20
00:01:46.519 --> 00:01:51.570
I remembered keeping a frog in a similar box when I was a little boy.

21
00:01:51.571 --> 00:01:57.182
"How strange to be treated like a captive frog," I said to myself.

22
00:01:57.183 --> 00:02:02.517
My master put Glumdalclitch on his horse and got on in front of her.

23
00:02:02.518 --> 00:02:05.619
"Hold the box tightly. Don't drop it!"

24
00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:08.723
he told her as we set off for the town.

25
00:02:08.724 --> 00:02:13.462
As the horse trotted along, I was bounced around violently.

26
00:02:13.463 --> 00:02:17.495
I felt as if I were on a ship in a very bad storm.

27
00:02:17.496 --> 00:02:23.170
But soon we arrived at the hotel where my master stayed on market days.

28
00:02:23.171 --> 00:02:28.206
"I want to rent your largest meeting room," he said to the hotel man.

29
00:02:28.207 --> 00:02:30.841
"I will have many guests tonight."

30
00:02:30.842 --> 00:02:38.905
My master hired a man to spread the word about the strange creature that would be on show at the hotel that night.

31
00:02:38.906 --> 00:02:44.357
"Come and see the tiny man!" this man shouted in the streets.

32
00:02:44.358 --> 00:02:49.598
"It walks, it talks, but it's only the size of a small doll!"

33
00:02:49.599 --> 00:02:52.998
Many people came to the hotel that evening.

34
00:02:52.999 --> 00:02:56.589
My master put me on the table in the meeting room.

35
00:02:56.590 --> 00:03:03.294
"Glumdalclitch," he said to his daughter, "make Grildig show the people what he can do."

36
00:03:03.295 --> 00:03:09.765
"I'm sorry," she whispered to me, "but please do what my father wants."

37
00:03:09.766 --> 00:03:14.515
She sat nearby while I bowed to the crowd.

38
00:03:14.516 --> 00:03:18.711
"I'm delighted to meet you all," I said.

39
00:03:18.712 --> 00:03:23.894
I walked about and answered the people's questions in a loud voice.

40
00:03:23.895 --> 00:03:29.398
They clapped and cheered when I pulled out my sword and pretended to fight.

41
00:03:29.399 --> 00:03:35.803
My master let only thirty people into the room at a time so that all could see me well.

42
00:03:35.804 --> 00:03:41.762
I performed for 12 groups that night, and everyone paid my master for the show.

43
00:03:41.763 --> 00:03:46.838
He watched the people carefully and would not let anyone touch me.

44
00:03:46.839 --> 00:03:51.816
I was valuable to him, so he did not want me to get hurt.

45
00:03:51.817 --> 00:03:56.025
Throughout the evening, the crowd outside the hotel grew.

46
00:03:56.026 --> 00:03:58.229
"Come again on the next market day.

47
00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:02.445
Send your friends," my master told the people.

48
00:04:02.446 --> 00:04:08.119
I was so exhausted after the last show that I could hardly stand up.

49
00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:14.428
The next day, we went home, and after three days I began to feel a little better.

50
00:04:14.429 --> 00:04:19.369
But even at the farmer's house, people demanded to see me.

51
00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:28.882
My master got more and more money, and I got more and more tired.
